        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-20T21:35:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Engine Bunker may always have that power, but he does not always have Mode cards to discard to it.&nbsp; :)&nbsp; I find he dies to Iron Legacy just as well as everybody else.&nbsp; But yeah, the best heroes against Iron Legacy have plenty of Ongoing removal.&nbsp; Absolute Zero works well.&nbsp; Fanatic, for End of Days.&nbsp; Tempest and Omnitron-X, for their cards that destroy 2 ongoings.&nbsp; Anybody else with it might be nice, they just have to draw it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 71,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:28:53.171Z",
