      {
        "id": 54437,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-21T01:39:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"dragon2439\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dragon2439/48/2230_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dragon2439:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I cant wait to see absolute zero's nemesis.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Exactly. Sure he has Iron Legacy and will have Proletariat in Vengeance, but I am really looking for the villian that is just his and he doesn't share with 5 other heroes or played with other villians that are nemesis with other heroes. Though i'm not sure how Vengeance will play, and it'll at least be nice to face someone that won't punish you (too bad at least) for being a nemesis.</p>",
