      {
        "id": 54439,
        "name": "Cosmonaut Zero",
        "username": "Cosmonaut_Zero",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/cosmonaut_zero/{size}/2520_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-21T07:39:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The feels to me like a timer. Ignore the environment, not enough things go in the trash and you lose. Thematically, the time portal is closing and you need to take care of business before it's gone. The discarding a card to discard the top environment is meant to represent a hero channeling energy to keep the portal open. It's a cost of missing other opportunities to buy the heroes more time.</p>",
