      {
        "id": 54441,
        "name": "EvanDan55",
        "username": "EvanDan55",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/{size}/2374_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-21T16:25:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"flamethrower49\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> flamethrower49:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You haven't even played it yet.&nbsp; Trust me when I say that Chrono-Ranger is super-useful against the Rat.&nbsp; He dies quickly, too, but since Chrono-Ranger's whole schtick is attacking a lot, he does more than his share of damage.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You've got me there–I still haven't tried it. We will at some point soon, and I promise to come back with my thoughts.</p>",
